    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a hero with the unique ability to manipulate their form. Using this power, they can shift from a pixelated animation to complex voxel structures, even transforming into a sword to face the dangers of this mysterious world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494320/extras/3980f49ec760187d70f75ef6cc8ece2b.poster.avif?t=1738238380\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494320/extras/3980f49ec760187d70f75ef6cc8ece2b.webm?t=1738238380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494320/extras/3980f49ec760187d70f75ef6cc8ece2b.mp4?t=1738238380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each transformation is essential for progress: squeezing through narrow grids in a voxel form or activating mechanisms by becoming a solid structure. The adventure combines exploration, strategy, and puzzle-solving, with challenges that test your ability to switch seamlessly between these forms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The environments are filled with puzzles, dangerous enemies, and hidden secrets, offering a playground that is both stimulating and intriguing. The game encourages experimentation and immersion with a visual style blending pixel art and voxels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is currently in development, and we\u2019re excited to share our progress with you. We\u2019re open to your feedback and ideas to make the game even better. Follow us on social media and Steam to stay updated on progress, new features, and key milestones.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a hero with the unique ability to manipulate their form. Using this power, they can shift from a pixelated animation to complex voxel structures, even transforming into a sword to face the dangers of this mysterious world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494320/extras/3980f49ec760187d70f75ef6cc8ece2b.poster.avif?t=1738238380\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494320/extras/3980f49ec760187d70f75ef6cc8ece2b.webm?t=1738238380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494320/extras/3980f49ec760187d70f75ef6cc8ece2b.mp4?t=1738238380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each transformation is essential for progress: squeezing through narrow grids in a voxel form or activating mechanisms by becoming a solid structure. The adventure combines exploration, strategy, and puzzle-solving, with challenges that test your ability to switch seamlessly between these forms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The environments are filled with puzzles, dangerous enemies, and hidden secrets, offering a playground that is both stimulating and intriguing. The game encourages experimentation and immersion with a visual style blending pixel art and voxels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is currently in development, and we\u2019re excited to share our progress with you. We\u2019re open to your feedback and ideas to make the game even better. Follow us on social media and Steam to stay updated on progress, new features, and key milestones.</p>",
    "short_description": "Embark on an adventure as a hero who can shift between pixelated and voxel forms, using these transformations to solve puzzles, battle enemies, and uncover secrets. Explore a visually striking world that blends pixel art and voxel design, encouraging creativity and strategy.",
